Tang Nano 20K firmware
======================

This directory contains the bare-metal PicoRV32 firmware for the Tang Nano
20K LD2450 reader.  The system clock is configured by CLK_FREQ in Makefile
and is currently 27000000 Hz.

Build with the MSYS2 RISC-V toolchain:

    make clean
    make

The build creates prog_20k.elf, prog_20k.bin, prog_20k.hex, and regenerates
../src/mem_init0.ini through mem_init3.ini plus ../src/sys_parameters.v.
Rebuild picorv32_20k.gprj after changing firmware.
